.TH HSYNC-SERVER 1 "2026-10-31" "hsync-server 1.0.16" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hsync-server \- HSYNC file synchronization server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hsync-server
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hsync-server
is the central HTTP/WebSocket server of the HSYNC sync network. It manages
buckets (shared directories), member accounts and per-account tokens, serves
file upload/download with delta transfer, and pushes live events to connected
clients over WebSocket.
.PP
Configuration is read from environment variables (prefix
.BR HSYNC_ ),
typically supplied through
.BR /etc/hsync-server/hsync-server.conf
by the packaged systemd unit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-host " " HOST
Bind address, optionally with a port (HOST[:PORT]). Default: 0.0.0.0.
.TP
.BR \-\-port " " PORT
Listen on PORT (default 9753). Mutually exclusive with a port in
.BR \-\-host .
.TP
.BR \-\-ssl
Enable HTTPS/WSS.
.TP
.BR \-\-ssl-cert " " PATH
Path to the TLS certificate file.
.TP
.BR \-\-ssl-key " " PATH
Path to the TLS private key file.
.TP
.BR \-\-ssl-cert-dir " " DIR
Directory for auto-generated TLS certificates (default: \fI./certs\fR).
Explicit
.BR \-\-ssl-cert
/
.BR \-\-ssl-key
paths take precedence when set.
.TP
.BR \-\-env-file " " PATH
Load environment variables from PATH (one KEY=VALUE per line).
.TP
.BR \-\-log-level " " LEVEL
Log level: debug, info, warning, error, critical (default info).
.TP
.BR \-\-color " " MODE
Colorize log output: auto (only on a terminal), always, never (default auto).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HSYNC_ADMIN_KEY
Rendezvous admin secret (64 hex characters, optional).
.TP
.B HSYNC_BUCKETS
Path to the buckets directory (default:
.IR <app>/buckets ).
.TP
.B HSYNC_STATE_DIR
Path to the per-bucket state DB directory
.RI ( <state-dir>/server/<bucket>.db
per bucket plus the global
.IR <state-dir>/server/auth.db ;
default:
.IR <app>/state ).
When
.B HSYNC_STATE_DB
is set, that single file is used for every bucket instead.
.TP
.B HSYNC_STATE_DB
Explicit single sync-state database path. When set, every bucket shares this
one SQLite file instead of the per-bucket layout above. Useful for tests and
manual isolation.
.TP
.B HSYNC_SSL_CERT_DIR
Directory for auto-generated TLS certificates (default:
.IR <app>/certs ).
Explicit
.B HSYNC_SSL_CERTFILE
/
.B HSYNC_SSL_KEYFILE
paths take precedence when set.
.TP
.B HSYNC_LOG_FILE
Path to the optional log file (unset by default: log to the service journal /
stderr).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/hsync-server/hsync-server.conf
Package configuration (EnvironmentFile), owned root:root (0600).
.TP
.I /var/lib/hsync-server/buckets
Bucket data (see
.BR HSYNC_BUCKETS ).
.TP
.I /var/lib/hsync-server/state/server/<bucket>.db
Per-bucket sync-state database, plus the global
.I /var/lib/hsync-server/state/server/auth.db
(see
.BR HSYNC_STATE_DIR ).
.TP
.I /var/lib/hsync-server/state/.hsyncnodeid
Server node identity (author of out-of-band edits).
.TP
.I /var/lib/hsync-server/certs
Auto-generated TLS identity (see
.BR HSYNC_SSL_CERT_DIR ).
.TP
.I /var/log/hsync-server/hsync-server.log
Service logs (see
.BR HSYNC_LOG_FILE ).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemd.exec (5)
.P
.RS
